   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Falling Out**: back after 197 archived shows (1615 days) [4]\n- **What a Fool Believes**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **The Stallion (Part 5)**: back after 52 archived shows (497 days) [4]\n- **Puffy Cloud**: back after 199 archived shows (1616 days) [4]\n- **Fancy Pants**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2004-10-03** (recommended): source not stated; 40 songs; 190 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **ween2004-10-03.mk4.flac16**: source not stated; 40 songs; 190 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A three-camera DVD using this audio circulates, as does a one-camera DVD that is likely more widely traded [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2004-10-03**: Recorded with Schoeps MK4V microphones into a Sonosax preamp, then a Sony SBM1 with 24-bit mod, then a Sony D100 [1]\n- **ween2004-10-03.mk4.flac16**: taped by Jon Merin; transferred by Jon Merin; source: Schoeps MK4->KC5->CMC6->V3->VX pocket V2->fujitsu 7010->Wave Lab 5.0 (24/48) [2]",
